<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Approval Pending — RKU Portal</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font-family:"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e1b4b 50%,#0f172a 100%);min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;}
.wrap{text-align:center;max-width:460px;width:100%;}
.icon-wrap{width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);border:2px solid rgba(245,158,11,.25);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 24px;animation:pulse 2s infinite;}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(245,158,11,.3);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 16px rgba(245,158,11,0);}}
.icon-wrap i{font-size:3rem;color:#fbbf24;}
.card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:24px;padding:40px 32px;backdrop-filter:blur(20px);}
.badge-tag{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);margin-bottom:16px;display:block;}
h2{color:#fff;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-.4px;}
p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.7;}
.email-badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;display:inline-block;margin:16px 0;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
.status-box{background:rgba(245,158,11,.06);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.18);border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0;text-align:left;}
.status-box strong{display:block;color:#fbbf24;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;}
.status-box ul{padding-left:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;}
.btn-logout{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4f7ef7,#6366f1);color:#fff;padding:12px 28px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;transition:.2s;margin-top:8px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(79,126,247,.3);}
.btn-logout:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(79,126,247,.4);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fas fa-user-clock"></i></div>
  <div class="card">
    <span class="badge-tag">RKU Attendance Portal</span>
    <h2>Access Pending</h2>
    <p>Your registration has been received! A SuperAdmin must manually verify your identity before you can access the portal.</p>
    <div class="email-badge"><i class="fas fa-envelope" style="margin-right:6px;opacity:.6;"></i><%= user.email %></div>
    <div class="status-box">
      <strong><i class="fas fa-list-check" style="margin-right:6px;"></i> Next Steps</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Notify your Department Head</li>
        <li>Verification usually takes 2–4 hours</li>
        <li>Once approved, you gain full dashboard access</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:20px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);">If urgent, contact the IT Helpdesk.</p>
    <a href="/logout" class="btn-logout"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Return to Login</a>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>